#. module: account_online_payment
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_online_payment/models/account_payment.py:0
msgid "You cannot modify a payment that has already been sent to the bank."
msgstr "Je kunt een betaling die al naar de bank is gestuurd niet wijzigen."

#. module: account_online_payment
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_online_payment/models/account_online_link.py:0
msgid ""
"You haven't completed your KYC yet, so you can't process payment directly "
"from Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Je hebt je KYC nog niet afgerond, dus je kunt de betaling niet direct vanuit "
"Odoo verwerken."

#. module: account_online_payment
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_online_payment/models/account_payment.py:0
msgid "You must select at least one payment."
msgstr "Je moet ten minste één betaalmethode selecteren."

#. module: account_online_payment
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_online_payment/models/account_online_account.py:0
msgid ""
"Your bank allows a maximum of %(limit)s payments per batch.\n"
"If you want to send your payments through Odoo, please split your batch."
msgstr ""
"Je bank staat maximaal %(limit)s betalingen per batch toe.\n"
"Als je betalingen via Odoo wilt versturen, splits dan je batch op."

#. module: account_online_payment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_online_payment.view_batch_payment_form_inherit
msgid "Your payment activation is pending, please wait!"
msgstr "Je betalingsactivatie is in behandeling, even geduld alsjeblieft!"

